OL,3,GWest Midlands
OL,4,
OL,5,CToday:FA cloudy and damp start for
OL,6,Fmost, as patchy cloud and rain spread
OL,7,Fnothwestward. Variable cloud and sunny
OL,8,Fspells developing through the
OL,9,Fafternoon. Light to moderate
OL,10,Fsoutheasterly winds.
OL,11,
OL,12,CTonight:FDry with some clear spells
OL,13,Finitially, although cloud and rain are
OL,14,Fexpected to push north through the
OL,15,Fearly hours. Low cloud and hill fog
OL,16,Flikely over higher ground.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
OL,24,ANext Page  BWeather  CReg News  FReg TV
