OL,3,GWest Midlands
OL,4,
OL,5,CTuesday:FA damp and cloudy start
OL,6,Facross much of the region. This
OL,7,Fgradually moves eastward through the
OL,8,Fafternoon allowing for some brightness
OL,9,Fthrough the evening in the west.
OL,10,
OL,11,COutlook for Wednesday to Friday:FWet
OL,12,Fand windy on Wednesday, before sunny
OL,13,Fspells and showers develop into
OL,14,FThursday with lighter winds. Then
OL,15,Fheavy rain will spread northeastwards
OL,16,Finto Friday with strong winds likely.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
